  "description": "Run SSRS and Power BI paginated reports (RDL) in managed .NET: a lossless report definition model with validation and schema upgrade, an interpreted VB expression engine with a function catalogue, processing against data the host supplies (no query is ever executed), and pagination of tablix, charts, gauges, maps, images, subreports and barcodes into a page model. The pages render to PDF and images through DocWright, and export to Word, Excel, CSV, text and HTML through DocWright.Reporting.Export and DocWright.Reporting.Viewer. Read and write .rdl files with DocWright.Reporting.Rdl.",
